---
import { weeklyBrief } from '../../lib/projects';
---

<section class="shell two-column">
  <div class="section-panel content-block">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Weekly Notes</p>
        <h2>{weeklyBrief.headline}</h2>
      </div>
      <span class="pill subtle">{weeklyBrief.weekLabel}</span>
    </div>

    <p class="muted">{weeklyBrief.summary}</p>

    <div class="list-stack" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
      {weeklyBrief.signals.map((signal) => (
        <article class="stack-item">
          <div class="meta-pair">
            <span class="pill">{signal.label}</span>
          </div>
          <p class="data-kicker" style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">{signal.text}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-panel sidebar-block">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Use This Well</p>
        <h2>這塊該怎麼經營</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="list-stack">
      <div class="flow-step">
        <strong>每週更新一次就夠</strong>
        <p class="muted">它不是新聞快訊，而是用來給這站一點判斷力與節奏感。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-step">
        <strong>用短評，不用長文</strong>
        <p class="muted">一句到兩句最剛好，重點是讓使用者知道你為什麼現在看這些 repo。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-step">
        <strong>搭配 Discussions 開題</strong>
        <p class="muted">首頁寫完觀察後，最自然的下一步就是把題目丟到社群裡討論。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="notice">
      <p>
        之後你只要改 <code>src/data/weekly-brief.json</code>，
        這塊首頁內容就會跟著換，不需要再動 Astro 模板。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
